{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026yUQBXVXEpT1795563758.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>受東北季候風影響，本港今早各區氣溫普遍較昨日低四度左右，日間最高氣溫約22度。</p><p></p><p>天文台科學主任呂旭昇表示︰「今早受到東北季候風影響，天氣涼了一點，大家出門謹記帶備外套，傍身保暖比較穩妥。截至早上約六時，各區氣溫介乎16至19度，與昨天差不多時間相比，大部分地區氣溫下降了4至5度。」</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.HKO-0730.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026LftpbC8Q2B1795563753.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>受天文大潮及東北季候風共同影響，預料今晚沿岸水位較正常稍高，部分低窪地區可能出現輕微水浸。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.HKO-0730_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026qKpWm64EhN1795563756.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>天文台預測明早仍然清涼，周五、周六氣溫回升，介乎20至26度，內陸地區日夜溫差頗大。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T02:42:55.555708+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":230,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T23:37:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T21:20:25.268185+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T02:36:06.105527+00:00","content_hash":"a0e2ade42bd69ab43f921a79d71aedd44d6114ee07126fe5a5c02ead1a7c9d19","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-25T02:42:55.555708+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}